# Staging branch workflow

Use the long-lived `staging` branch for every website change.

1. Commit and push to `staging` only.
2. Never push or merge to `main` unless the user explicitly says: "merge staging to main".
3. After each push, report this preview URL and confirm the Vercel Preview deployment finished:
   https://student-eb-5-git-staging-jordancchaplin-gmailcoms-projects.vercel.app
4. When the user says "merge staging to main", merge with a merge commit (no squash, no rebase onto main), push `main`, and confirm the production deploy. Do not delete `staging`.
